sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Browser as Browser UI
  participant Auth as Managed Auth Provider
  participant API as Rust API
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant SDK as Python SDK

  Browser->>Auth: Sign in with Google
  Auth-->>Browser: Secure session / JWT
  Browser->>API: Request org-scoped data
  API->>Auth: Validate token and issuer
  API->>DB: Upsert user identity if needed
  API->>DB: Check organization membership and role
  DB-->>API: Authorized principal + org context
  API-->>Browser: Org-scoped response

  SDK->>API: POST metrics with Authorization: Bearer API key
  API->>DB: Hash lookup by key prefix
  API->>DB: Check service account, scopes, expiry, revocation, project limit
  DB-->>API: Authorized service principal
  API->>DB: Execute scoped ingestion transaction
  API-->>SDK: Compatible JSON response
